  "correction_note": "arches re-pointed to stage-matched t; pericardium declared in gaps. Anatomical defects found in the MODEL are listed as findings on the queue item and were not patched from the scene.",
  "rebuilt_at": "2026-09-10",
  "rebuilt_by": "model3d BUILD task — round 1 rework",
  "correction_note_round_2": "Corrected two false claims in gaps[] (the t=0.65 justification, which was derived from a mis-implemented acceptance test, and a stale arches_b @0.4 reference). No geometry or narration changed. The anatomical defects found this round are in the MODEL and are listed as findings on the queue item."
